  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0: the first release. Reads the first full-resolution page of TIFF and BigTIFF files: strips or tiles, none/PackBits/LZW/Deflate (predictors 2 and 3), JPEG and CCITT RLE/Group 3/Group 4; greyscale, palette, RGB, CMYK, YCbCr and 32-bit float with alpha; ICC, XMP, EXIF and orientation. Requires PictureSharp 0.7.8. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Tiff/blob/v0.3.0/docs/releases/release-0.3.0.md",
